<title>USA: MGE wheat/barley/shrimp deliveries - Dec 10.</title>
<headline>MGE wheat/barley/shrimp deliveries - Dec 10.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Minneapolis Grain Exchange Grain reported the following deliveries against December futures (wheat in 000 bu, shrimp in lots) -</p>
<p>SPRING WHEAT - Nil. Oldest long October 7, 1996.</p>
<p>WHITE WHEAT - Nil. Oldest long August 16, 1996.</p>
<p>BLACK TIGER SHRIMP - 14. Oldest long November 22, 1996.</p>
<p>Put out by - Cargill Investor Services/c 14.</p>
<p>Stopped by - Country Hedging/c 3, Cargill Investor Services/c 3, Frontier Futures/c2, Goldenberg Hehmeyer/c 6.</p>
<p>BARLEY - Nil. Oldest long July 30, 1996.</p>
<p>WHITE SHRIMP - Nil.</p>
<p>H=House. C=Customer account.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
